const faqs = [
  { q: 'How much does it cost to replace a kitchen sink in Liverpool?', a: 'With us it is £225 including VAT for a like-for-like swap. You supply the sink, tap and waste, and we fit them. Moving the sink or cutting a new hole in the worktop is priced before we start.' },
  { q: 'How long does it take to replace a kitchen sink?', a: 'Most like-for-like swaps take 2 to 3 hours. A stuck old sink, rusted fittings or a tricky tap can add a little time. The price stays fixed for a like-for-like job.' },
  { q: 'Do I need to buy the sink and tap first?', a: 'Yes. Our £225 price is fit only. Buy the sink, tap and waste kit before we come. Send us a link to what you want, and we will check it suits your worktop and pipes.' },
  { q: 'Can you fit a bigger or different shaped sink?', a: 'Often, yes. If the new sink is bigger, the hole in the worktop has to be cut larger. We price that before we start. If the new sink is smaller than the old hole, it will not fit, so check the sizes first.' },
  { q: 'Can you fit an undermount or Belfast sink?', a: 'An undermount sink needs a solid worktop cut and finished to suit it. A Belfast sink needs a special base unit and a worktop cut around it. We do not fit worktops, so these are best done by your kitchen fitter. We can do the plumbing once the sink is in place.' },
  { q: 'Can you move my kitchen sink?', a: 'Yes. We can move the water pipes and the waste pipe to a new spot. The price depends on the distance and the route of the waste pipe, so we price it before we start.' },
  { q: 'My sink is leaking underneath. What is it?', a: 'Most leaks under a kitchen sink come from the trap, the waste, the overflow or a tap hose. A loose or cracked trap is common. We fix these by the hour. The first hour is £120 on weekdays 9am to 4pm, with no call-out fee.' },
  { q: 'What should I do if my sink is leaking now?', a: 'Put a bowl under the drip and stop using the sink. If water is coming from a pipe or hose, turn off the isolation valve under the sink, or the stopcock. Then call us on 0151 558 0334.' },
  { q: 'Will you reconnect my dishwasher or washing machine?', a: 'If the drain hose already runs to the old sink trap, we reconnect it to the new one. Plumbing in a new appliance, or adding new pipes for one, is priced before we start.' },
  { q: 'Do you replace bathroom basins?', a: 'Yes. We swap bathroom basins and pedestals, and fit new basin taps and wastes. Tell us what you have and what you are fitting, and we will give you a fixed price before we start.' },
  { q: 'Do you take the old sink away?', a: 'Yes, if you want us to. Just tell us when you book.' },
  { q: 'Is the work guaranteed?', a: 'Yes. Our workmanship has a 12-month guarantee. The sink and tap are covered by the maker’s warranty. We carry £2 million public liability insurance.' },
  { q: 'Can you replace the tap without changing the sink?', a: 'Yes. A kitchen tap swap is £110 including VAT when you supply the tap. A second tap on the same visit is £50. See our tap replacement page for more.' },
  { q: 'Do you cover my area?', a: 'We cover all of Liverpool, plus the Wirral, Sefton, Knowsley and St Helens. There is no call-out fee in any of these areas.' },
];
